<div class="space-y-4">
  <div class="gw-window gw-frame p-6 leading-relaxed">
    <%= render 'documentation/breadcrumb', page: 'Scrim Commands' %>

    <h1 class="font-display text-gold-300 text-2xl tracking-wide m-0 mt-3">Scrim Commands</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mt-1 mb-0">Manage scrim registration and teams</p>

    <div class="flex gap-6 mt-6">
      <%= render 'documentation/sidebar' %>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 gw-doc">
        <h2>Queue Management</h2>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim panel</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Display the scrim registration panel with interactive buttons</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim panel</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Features:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Shows current global queue across all servers</li>
            <li>Interactive buttons for quick actions</li>
            <li>Auto-refreshes when any action occurs on any server</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Panel Buttons:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Register</strong> - Add yourself to the queue</li>
            <li><strong>Unregister</strong> - Remove yourself from the queue</li>
            <li><strong>AFK</strong> - Mark yourself as AFK</li>
            <li><strong>Back (from AFK)</strong> - Return from AFK status</li>
            <li><strong>Refresh</strong> - Refresh the panel display</li>
            <li><strong>Reset Queue</strong> - Clear entire queue (moderators only)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim register</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Register for the scrim queue</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> Click the "Register" button in the scrim panel or use the command</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>You have been registered, &lt;username&gt;!</code></p>
          <button type="button" class="gw-btn gw-btn--ghost" onclick="toggleExample('register')">Show Example</button>
          <div id="example-register" class="mt-2" style="display: none;">
            <div class="gw-parchment rounded-md border border-gold-600/40 p-4">
              <p class="m-0"><strong>Example Output:</strong></p>
              <p class="m-0">You have been registered, Arka!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim unregister</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Unregister from the scrim queue</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> Click the "Unregister" button or use the command</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>You have been unregistered, &lt;username&gt;!</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim queue</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Show the current scrim queue</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim queue</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong></p>
          <pre class="bg-ink-deep border border-gold-600/50 rounded p-3 overflow-x-auto text-sm">&lt;@user&gt;, the current players ordered by registration time are:
#1 &lt;@player1&gt; (**IGN1**)
#2 &lt;@player2&gt; (**IGN2**)
...
We need X more players.</pre>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-8">Team Management</h2>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim team new</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Form new teams for the next series (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim team new</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Requires:</strong> Exactly 16 players in queue</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Note:</strong> Teams are automatically formed when the 16th player registers</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim team win</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Record a game win for a team (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim team win &lt;a|b&gt;</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Example:</strong> <code>/scrim team win a</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Note:</strong> Best of 3 series. Elo is updated when a team reaches 2 wins.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim team captains</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> See the current captains</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim team captains</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim team roll</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Roll a random number between 0-100</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim team roll</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, you rolled: &lt;number&gt;</code></p>
          <button type="button" class="gw-btn gw-btn--ghost" onclick="rollExample()">Roll Example</button>
          <div id="example-roll" class="mt-2" style="display: none;">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim team move</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Move the current queue to the Scrimers voice channel (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim team move</code></p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-8">Moderator Commands</h2>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim reset</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Reset the current scrim queue (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim reset</code> or click "Reset Queue" button in panel</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, you successfully reset the current queue.</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim add</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Add a player to the queue by in-game name (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim add &lt;igname&gt;</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim remove</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Remove a player from the queue by in-game name (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim remove &lt;igname&gt;</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim afk</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Mark a player as AFK (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim afk [@user]</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Note:</strong> Users can also click the "AFK" button in the panel to mark themselves</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/scrim back</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Bring a player back from AFK (moderators only)</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/scrim back [@user]</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Note:</strong> Users can also click the "Back (from AFK)" button in the panel to return themselves</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>Related Pages</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><%= link_to 'View current scrim queue', scrims_path %></li>
            <li><%= link_to 'See all scrims', scrims_path %></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>Cross-Server Features</h2>
          <p>The scrim system now supports <strong>cross-server synchronization</strong>:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Use <code>/scrim panel</code> on any server to display the registration panel</li>
            <li>All panels across all servers show the same global queue</li>
            <li>Any action (register, unregister, afk, back, reset) on any server automatically refreshes all panels</li>
            <li>Button actions work from any server and update all panels globally</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Note:</strong> Panels are tracked in memory and will be cleared on bot restart.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function toggleExample(type) {
  const element = document.getElementById(`example-${type}`);
  if (element.style.display === 'none') {
    element.style.display = 'block';
  } else {
    element.style.display = 'none';
  }
}

function rollExample() {
  const element = document.getElementById('example-roll');
  const roll = Math.floor(Math.random() * 101);
  element.innerHTML = `
    <div class="gw-parchment rounded-md border border-gold-600/40 p-4">
      <p class="m-0"><strong>Example Output:</strong></p>
      <p class="m-0">&lt;@user&gt;, you rolled: ${roll}</p>
    </div>
  `;
  element.style.display = 'block';
}
</script>
